       <name slugifiedName="name-abnf-for-pop-url-scheme">ABNF for POP URL scheme</name>
       <t indent="0" pn="section-8-1">The POP URL scheme is described using <xref target="ABNF" format="default" sectionFormat="of" derivedContent="ABNF"/>:</t>
-      <t indent="0" pn="section-8-2"><artwork name="" type="" align="left" alt=""><![CDATA[
-     achar            = uchar / "&" / "=" / "~"
